## Third-party data notice

The German Traffic Sign Recognition Benchmark (GTSRB) is distributed separately and is
**not** included in this repository or in its license. It is used here under the terms
published with the benchmark:

> J. Stallkamp, M. Schlipsing, J. Salmen, and C. Igel, "The German Traffic Sign
> Recognition Benchmark: A multi-class classification competition," in *Proc. IJCNN*,
> 2011, pp. 1453-1460. doi: 10.1109/IJCNN.2011.6033395

Pre-trained ImageNet weights downloaded through `torchvision` remain subject to their own
licenses.
